# A1, vote: append vote bit 0. A read uses B2, B2, 00, 00, 00.
# The last byte carries the response and consumes the history.
SPI
start: IF_BYTE 0xa1 vote | TAG
       IF_BYTE 0xb2 decide | CMD
       QUIET
decide: IF_STATE 3 3 granted
       REPLY 0 consume
granted: REPLY 0xa5 consume
consume: SET_STATE 0 start | END MISO_DATA
vote: SHIFT_BIT start | END CMD MOSI_DATA
